  {
    "who": "leon",
    "message": "The Buy Button script mounts once and does not know about Astro’s view transitions, so re‑initialise it on `astro:page-load`:\n\n```astro\n---\nconst { productId } = Astro.props\n---\n<div class=\"buy-button\" data-product-id={productId}></div>\n\n<script>\n  import { mountBuyButtons } from '../lib/shopify'\n  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => mountBuyButtons())\n</script>\n```\n\nIn `mountBuyButtons()`, create the client once (module scope) and only call `ui.createComponent('product', …)` for nodes that do not have a `data-mounted` attribute yet. That avoids duplicate buttons when you navigate back.",
    "messageId": "4f2347f3-d253-45b4-8f29-56ae75269f78:leon",
