  {
    "who": "leon",
    "message": "That is the same issue one level up: the cart toggle component is created on every page load. Create it only once — guard with a module‑level flag:\n\n```ts\nlet cartReady = false\nexport function mountBuyButtons() {\n  if (!cartReady) {\n    ui.createComponent('cart', { moneyFormat: '{{amount_with_comma_separator}} €' })\n    cartReady = true\n  }\n  // …product buttons as before\n}\n```",
